{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38890","headline":"夏日留题张山人林亭 · 杜荀鹤","name":"夏日留题张山人林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此中偏称夏中游，时有风来暑气收。\n涧底松摇千尺雨，庭中竹撼一窗秋。\n求猿句寄山深寺，乞鹤书传海畔洲。\n闲与先生话身事，浮名薄宦总悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}